#: ../../../how-to/software/install-an-application.md:0
msgid ""
"Install a graphical application on Ubuntu Desktop using App Center, as a "
"snap or deb package."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/install-an-application.md:7
msgid "Topics: Software"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/install-an-application.md:11
msgid "Install an application"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/install-an-application.md:13
msgid ""
"An application is software that has a graphical user interface (GUI). The "
"Ubuntu Desktop team has chosen a default set of applications that we think "
"makes Ubuntu useful for most day-to-day tasks. However, you will want to "
"install more applications to make Ubuntu more useful to you. To install an "
"application, you can use *App Center*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/install-an-application.md:15
msgid ""
"Applications are available in {ref}`two formats <snap-and-deb-packages>`: "
"snap packages (\"snaps\") and Debian packages (\"debs\"). Some applications "
"are available in both formats. In such a case, the snap will be listed first "
"in App Center."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/install-an-application.md:18
msgid ""
"You can also use App Center to install software that doesn't have any GUI, "
"too."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/install-an-application.md:21
msgid "To install an application:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/install-an-application.md:23
msgid ""
"Click the App Center icon in the Dock, or search for *Software* in the "
"Activities search bar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/install-an-application.md:25
msgid ""
"When App Center launches, search for an application, or select a category "
"and find an application from the list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/install-an-application.md:27
msgid ""
"Select the application that you want to install and click {guilabel}"
"`Install`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/install-an-application.md:29
msgid ""
"App Center asks you to enter your password. Once you've done that, the "
"installation begins."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/install-an-application.md:31
msgid ""
"The installation usually finishes quickly, but it might take a while if you "
"have a slow Internet connection."
msgstr ""
